{"id":"word:hebrew:H4296","type":"word","title":"מִטָּה","subtitle":"H4296 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"a bed (as extended) for sleeping or eating; by analogy, a sofa , litter or bier","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to מִטָּה (H4296) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-f.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 29 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"מִטָּה (miṭṭâh) means a bed (as extended) for sleeping or eating; by analogy, a sofa , litter or bier First listed occurrence: 1Kgs 17 19."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"מִטָּה","transliteration":"miṭṭâh","pronunciation":"mit-taw'","strong":"H4296","lemmaId":"hebrew:H4296","partOfSpeech":"n-f","forms":["הַ/מִּטָּֽה","מִטָּתֽ/וֹ","הַ/מִּטָּ֞ה","הַ/מִּטָּ֑ה","הַ/מִּטּ֑וֹת"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncfsa",11],["HNcfsc/Sp3ms",7],["HNcfsa",3],["HTd/Ncfpa",2],["HNcfpc",2],["HRd/Ncfsa",1],["HNcfsc",1],["HNcfsc/Sp2ms",1],["HNcfsc/Sp1cs",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"a bed (as extended) for sleeping or eating; by analogy, a sofa , litter or bier","usage":"bed(-chamber), bier.","full":"H4296. mittah מִטָּה noun feminine couch, bed ( place of reclining ; מטותם Ecclus 48:6); &#8212; absolute מִטָּה Amos 3:12 14 t.; construct מִטַּת 2Kin 4:21 ; suffix מִטָּתִי Psa 6:7 , מִטָּתֶ֑ךָ Exodus 7:28, מִטָּתוֺ 2Sam 4:7 6 t.; plural מִטּוֺת absolute 2Kin 11:2 ; 2Chr 22:11 , construct Amos 6:4 ; Est 1:6 ; &#8212; couch, bed , common article of furniture 2Kin 4:10 , compare 4:21 ; 4:32 ; 1Kin 17:19 , for repose, especially at night, or in illness Gen 47:31 (J; הַמּ ׳ראֹשׁ ), compare 48:2 (J), 49:33 (P), Psa 6:7 ; Prov 26:14 ; 2Chr 24:25 (probably), and for sitting, or reclining by day 1Sam 28:23 ; 1Kin 21:4 ; מ ׳מְּאַת Amos 3:12 ; seat of King Solomon Song 3:7 ; in bed-chamber ( מִשְׁכָּב חֲדַר ) Exodus 7:28 (J), 2Sam 4:7 ; sometimes portable 1Sam 19:15 compare 19:13 ; 19:16 , hence = bier 2Sam 3:31 ; sometimes high 2Kin 1:4 , 6 , 16 ( שָׁם עָלָה opposed to מִן יָרַד ); sometimes costly, (with frames) of ivory Amos 6:4 ; for reclining at feasts, made of gold and silver Est 1:6 ; compare ׳מ כְּבוּדָּה Ezek 23:41 glorious couch ; הַמִּטּוֺת חֲדַר 2Kin 11:2 2Chr 22:11 (see חֶדֶר ). — compare also מִשְׁכָּב ( שׁכב ), עֶרֶשׂ .","rootNote":"from 5186 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 17 19","keyReferences":["1Kgs 17 19","1Kgs 21 4","1Sam 19 13","1Sam 19 15","1Sam 19 16","1Sam 28 23","2Chr 22 11","2Chr 24 25"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":29,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 17 19","book":"1Kgs","chapter":17,"verse":19,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִטָּתֽ/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 21 4","book":"1Kgs","chapter":21,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִטָּת֔/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Sam 19 13","book":"1Sam","chapter":19,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּטָּ֔ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 19 15","book":"1Sam","chapter":19,"verse":15,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בַ/מִּטָּ֛ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HRd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 19 16","book":"1Sam","chapter":19,"verse":16,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּטָּ֑ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"1Sam 28 23","book":"1Sam","chapter":28,"verse":23,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּטָּֽה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"2Chr 22 11","book":"2Chr","chapter":22,"verse":11,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּטּ֑וֹת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfpa"},{"reference":"2Chr 24 25","book":"2Chr","chapter":24,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִטָּת֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcfsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"2Kgs 1 4","book":"2Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":4,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/מִּטָּ֞ה","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncfsa"},{"reference":"2Kgs 1 6","boo